Bind Npc 13013 Zone 21
Quest 62 "Bandicoot hunt"
    Journal "[Sentinel] Patrick has asked me to hunt him 5 Bandicoots."
    Kill 5 of 850, 851, 853, 852 at direction_7

Requires player level >= 3

Rewards
    Give 375 experience
    Give 2700 coins

direction_4 = location "[Guard] Patrick" about "[Guard] Patrick\nSentinel with high self-esteem who guards Moradon; always strives for Moradon`s safety" found "Moradon central stepfront" at 830 551 in zone 21
direction_7 = location "Bandicoot" about "Bandicoot\nA rodent which grew abnormally by feeding on corpses of evil races in the War with Pathos." found "Inhabits Seashore of Hope" at 632 465 in zone 21

On available
    Say "Patrick's hiring more guards. Go and apply."
    Topic "Where is the [Sentinel]?" do
        Map direction_4

On offer
    Say "Have you seen monsters that look like rats in front of Moradon Castle?"
    Topic "Yes, I just saw him" do
        Show quest "They're called Bandicoots. They sometimes venture into the castle and gnaw on the gates and skedaddle. What a major headache. Get rid of 5 of them."

On in_progress
    Say "You still haven't caught all 5 Bandicoots?"
    Topic "Where can I find it?" do
        Map direction_7

On ready
    Say "Whoa, Master, you've caught all 5 Bandicoots. Bring them to the sentinel and get our reward."
    Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On claimable
    Show quest "Wow, I underestimated you. Here, this is compensation for guarding Moradon."

On completed
    Say "You are better than you look. Haha... You say it was a joke? I've prepared compensation for your trouble. Please kindly accept it."
